        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_c0ef18e3c87e465d8b7b65bd9a9b0872",
      "statement": "Direct client writes are minimal and self-scoped: players may update only their own profile (id = auth.uid()), manage only their own lobby_presence, and insert only their own move_submissions (player_id = auth.uid()); match_ratings write policies use WITH CHECK (false)/USING (false) so only service_role can write ratings.",
